# Always commit to GitHub

Whenever you edit files in this ZenIRCd repository:

1. After finishing the requested changes, create a git commit that includes those edits.
2. Push the commit to `origin` (GitHub: `zenircd/zenircd`) on the current branch.
3. Do this even if the user did not explicitly ask to commit or push.

Follow the normal commit workflow (status/diff/log, staged relevant files only, clear commit message). Do not skip hooks. Do not force-push unless the user explicitly asks.
